the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base haspurpose includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base haspurpose includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/hasPurpose.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


service statistical dissemination is identified by "http://example.org/Service_StatisticalDissemination".

service statistical dissemination is a public service.

service statistical dissemination has the title "European Statistical Dissemination Service".

service statistical dissemination has the purpose "Provide transparent access to European statistical data for citizens, researchers, and policy-makers".

service statistical dissemination has the purpose "Support evidence-based policy-making at EU and national levels".

service statistical dissemination has for "cpsv:hasCompetentAuthority" the resource "http://example.org/Agent_Eurostat".


service data quality assurance is identified by "http://example.org/Service_DataQualityAssurance".

service data quality assurance is a public service.

service data quality assurance has the title "Statistical Data Quality Assurance Service".

service data quality assurance has the purpose "Ensure reliability and comparability of European statistics".

service data quality assurance has the purpose "Build public trust in official statistics through quality verification".

service data quality assurance has for "cpsv:hasCompetentAuthority" the resource "http://example.org/Agent_Eurostat".


service member state data collection is identified by "http://example.org/Service_MemberStateDataCollection".

service member state data collection is a public service.

service member state data collection has the title "Member State Data Collection Service".

service member state data collection has the purpose "Gather harmonized fisheries data from all EU Member States".

service member state data collection has the purpose "Enable production of comparable European statistics".

service member state data collection has for "cpsv:hasCompetentAuthority" the resource "http://example.org/Agent_Eurostat".


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query public_services is:
    which thing is a public service.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query other_resources is:
    which thing has for which property the resource which resource.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

